  "body_html": "<p>Score a home run with our Custom Name Catcher Batter Baseball Throw Blanket! Perfect for any baseball enthusiast, this cozy and personalized blanket from Jeminise is a thoughtful gift for men, women, moms, dads, and baseball players for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom name and number options, making this blanket a unique and cherished gift for every baseball player.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in four convenient sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Crafted from Sherpa &amp; Fleece Fabric with two layers of Polyester and long-lasting color ink, ensuring a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas Day, or any special occasion for your loved ones who play or love baseball.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for quick drying and fluffiness. It's recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches) | Medium (50x40 inches) | Large (60x50 inches) | X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Wash separately in cold water and then either let them air dry without heat.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
